        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> X.E.H.A. Rogue is an interactive, branching visual novel where your choices determine how some scenes play out.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793430/extras/9cde165543898133cb9924ad21adb3b9.webp?t=1761170961\" width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Events on the planet Telvoikai and X.E.H.A.'s handling of the situation soured your opinion of the universe-dominating company and led to you going rogue. You've spent the last decade hunting bounties and taking mercenary work in your own name instead. Often these jobs brought you at odds with X.E.H.A., and they seem to have lost their patience. They steal your crew and force you to crash-land on an alien planet where you must start fresh with nothing but a dilapidated base and a... talking cat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793430/extras/cfa4c932857171c01f5257ccdba71027.webp?t=1761170961\" width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>&quot;YOU&quot; - Choose to play as Sivel or a custom character</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the captain of the highest level of a X.E.H.A. ship, Sivel's mother had hoped her daughter would one day take over. Instead, Sivel abandoned the ship and went off on her own with some of her android companions. (original appearance: Telvoikai)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793430/extras/22c191e763c11138c24980404201cfc1.avif?t=1761170961\" width=1411 height=775 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>MEET SOME NEW FACES:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793430/extras/74b6ae65db5c15b4553214c87f795c83.webp?t=1761170961\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793430/extras/74b6ae65db5c15b4553214c87f795c83.poster.avif?t=1761170961\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>GZ</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your last job was to procure a small container from a X.E.H.A. facility. While successful, they intervened shortly after and crashed your ship. They must not have cared about the stolen cargo, however, as they left it with you. Inside the container was a unique talking cat who introduces himself as &quot;GZ.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>CHTIA:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Chtia was a captive freed during one of your bounty jobs. Impressed by your tactics and your history, they begged to join your crew. Ever since then, they have been an inseparable presence on your ship, aiding however able.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>KAITEL and ISHI:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Kaitel is a local farmer who lives near the edge of the neighboring village with his daughter, Ishi. He helps you clean up the base and grow food to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>TETHATHRO:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A mercenary who spends most of his time taking small caravan guard jobs between cities, Tethathro's true focus is visiting the local libraries for dragon-specific lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>AND MANY FAMILIAR FROM REVISITED WORLDS:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793430/extras/6f2294b35e44f7c01fe8069e37de071d.webp?t=1761170961\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793430/extras/6f2294b35e44f7c01fe8069e37de071d.poster.avif?t=1761170961\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793430/extras/1a5fcc08fdc98572f74544fd0700c4b6.webp?t=1761170961\" width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose from multiple romance options, or keep it platonic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793430/extras/a3210b945c1f2d17bb650f5760625105.avif?t=1761170961\" width=1560 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793430/extras/88c4e2870545fae2dd1ed52f118f2a74.webp?t=1761170961\" width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While there are only two basic endings to the game and <u>no bad endings</u><strong>,</strong> your choices will instead change what happens <u>during</u> the story. Multiple scenes will play out in different ways based on where your stats have fallen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793430/extras/e84dba1ccbbdbdab0c85fee3bc74bef8.poster.avif?t=1761170961\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793430/extras/e84dba1ccbbdbdab0c85fee3bc74bef8.mp4?t=1761170961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>GAMEPLAY:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X.E.H.A. Rogue is a branching visual novel with one main difference from previous tales: there is no risk of a bad ending. A cozier storyline written as a thank you to those who enjoy the &quot;<i>Ethikai&quot;</i> universe,<i> Rogue</i> is full of references, characters, and places from the previous stories while also maintaining its own unique tale so any who have<i> not</i> read the others may still enjoy the story.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching storyline </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional romance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-Painted character art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connects and continues the story from four previous titles (Telvoikai, Eyes of Rain, Vogvhathos, and The Dust of the Violet Crystals)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collapsible UI for a cleaner view if desired</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple save slots, and save at any time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
